  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: "Default level setting\nTHis is where designer construct a level\n1. Click
    LoadandCalculate Default file, this will load the default file which contain level
    index\n   \tthis scrip will calculate sum dist, rot and cm for each joint\n2.
    print default to target file will output sum dist,rot and cm to target file;\n3.
    Update default file if you change the default level eg. level index\n\n\n\nTargetSetting;\n
    this is where you edit your target for joint dis, rot and cm before output to
    target file \nIF you modify your importance joint setting and you want to go back
    to defult setting, you need to use  defual level setting  file to update the  setting. "
